claim.claim-text:
obtaining, from a base station (102), first configuration information on a first resource set of at least one first signal for channel measurement and second configuration information on a second resource set of at least one second signal for interference measurement;
receiving, from the base station (102), the at least one first signal for channel measurement and the at least one second signal for interference measurement, based on the first resource set and the second resource set, respectively;
measuring multiple signal-to-interference and noise ratio, SINR, values based on the received at least one first signal and the received at least one second signal; and
transmitting, to the base station (102), the multiple SINR values and multiple resource indicators related to the at least one first signal,
wherein the multiple resource indicators correspond respectively to the multiple SINR values, and
wherein each resource in the first resource set is associated with one resource in the second resource set.
